OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer in tears as she admits
OL,4,Aerrors connected to fatal crash
OL,5,Ainquiry, hearing told
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer broke down in tears as
OL,8,Fshe admitted errors in her assessment
OL,9,Fof the risk of one of three young women
OL,10,Freported missing who was involved in a
OL,11,Ffatal crash.
OL,13,FPC Lauren Livingstone is one of two
OL,14,Fofficers facing gross misconduct
OL,15,Fallegations over her actions before a
OL,16,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,17,Fcrashed in St Mellons, Cardiff, on 6
OL,18,FMarch 2023.
OL,20,FEve Smith, Rafel Jeanne, and Darcy Ross
OL,21,Fall died in the crash. Sophie Russon
OL,22,Fand Shane Loughlin survived.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
