OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer in tears as she admits
OL,4,Aerrors connected to fatal crash
OL,5,Ainquiry, hearing told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe three women were reported missing
OL,8,Fto Gwent Police on 4 March, and
OL,9,FLivingstone said she could not remember
OL,10,Fwhether searches had been carried out
OL,11,Fat the homes of Sophie Russon or Eve
OL,12,FSmith, maintaining her account since
OL,13,FMarch 2024.
